                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1ba994ab-af38-3bc4-a3aa-c77d9b9239ea",
                        "entry_id": "b07cc72e-a679-34d2-a1dc-1dca30e2e77c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "отсутствие желания"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0b4635a8-063b-4bd7-87b1-47f19fb8b03c",
                                "sense_id": "1ba994ab-af38-3bc4-a3aa-c77d9b9239ea",
                                "text": "Кой грех отец заподозрит их в умысле, тогда уж не поверит и правде; он ещё и прежде, когда старики приискали было невесту своему сыну, дал им почувствовать, что понимает их нежелание видеть брата женатым."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "41dc010d-9938-490e-a28f-c4ec513e3f45",
                                "sense_id": "1ba994ab-af38-3bc4-a3aa-c77d9b9239ea",
                                "text": "Такой же причиной, как отказ Наполеона отвести свои войска за Вислу и отдать назад герцогство Ольденбургское, представляется нам и желание или нежелание первого французского капрала поступить на вторичную службу: ибо, ежели бы он не захотел идти на службу и не захотел бы другой, и третий, и тысячный капрал и солдат, настолько менее людей было бы в войске Наполеона, и войны не могло бы быть."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bb386f59-0e27-4e0a-8d6a-70cbe084f09e",
                        "source_entry_id": "b07cc72e-a679-34d2-a1dc-1dca30e2e77c",
                        "source_sense_id": "1ba994ab-af38-3bc4-a3aa-c77d9b9239ea",
                        "target_lang_word": "unwillingness",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "unwillingness",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "88c05c6e-3eca-39e9-9fac-78d5115fa43d",
                                        "entry_id": "81f29d0a-3c96-3812-99b2-d3ce46004928",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The property of being unwilling."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e220f609-71cb-434c-9008-81e391c71588",
                                                "sense_id": "88c05c6e-3eca-39e9-9fac-78d5115fa43d",
                                                "text": "In the second extract, the teacher formulated Anna's resistance as reported by Tonie as a prewillingness rather than unwillingness. She constructed Anna's prewillingness as founded in her precompetence, rather than incompetence."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "39e35d60-fabb-434d-803b-f78a4e03d9e2",
                        "source_entry_id": "b07cc72e-a679-34d2-a1dc-1dca30e2e77c",
                        "source_sense_id": "1ba994ab-af38-3bc4-a3aa-c77d9b9239ea",
                        "target_lang_word": "reluctance",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "reluctance",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b53d575b-2a45-367f-ba17-78c0ad0334d6",
                                        "entry_id": "2fe9c340-bf03-32ae-b949-77bc6a77710a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Unwillingness to do something."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "64b1b00e-20f9-4cfb-8b42-aedc958da58d",
                                                "sense_id": "b53d575b-2a45-367f-ba17-78c0ad0334d6",
                                                "text": "Our new dog shows reluctance to go on walks, preferring to be indoors."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "af6e6dcb-6cca-359f-b153-0ec87d64d6c4",
                                        "entry_id": "2fe9c340-bf03-32ae-b949-77bc6a77710a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Hesitancy in taking some action."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "375a1ffe-ffac-39fc-b665-b33b7dc10df8",
                                        "entry_id": "2fe9c340-bf03-32ae-b949-77bc6a77710a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Defiance, disobedience."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic",
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "704eb547-1109-4bc5-abd7-d5a4b44e5a62",
                                                "sense_id": "375a1ffe-ffac-39fc-b665-b33b7dc10df8",
                                                "text": "No more be mention’d then of violence / Against our selves, and wilful barrenness, / That cuts us off fom hope, and favours onely / Rancor and pride, impatience and despite, / Reluctance against God and his just yoke / Laid on our Necks."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cd31a16c-2cb1-3a6f-ae7a-9e92ccf5398f",
                                        "entry_id": "2fe9c340-bf03-32ae-b949-77bc6a77710a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "That property of a magnetic circuit analogous to resistance in an electric circuit."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4cc2905f-576a-4c5d-813b-fba3a6f6e879",
                                                "sense_id": "cd31a16c-2cb1-3a6f-ae7a-9e92ccf5398f",
                                                "text": "That is to say, the total number of ampere-hours, including the drop of gilbertage, due to magnetic flux traversing the reluctance of the circuit, must be equal to zero."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
